Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 22:25:56 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1181/1286] HERESY 1168: the (i) marks without notes after them
 (the notes are their tips' first lines); the Takes' star as our icon; a take
 moved to the trash leaves the player
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor, 06.10.2026:
- «Пройдись по всей Студии и везде, где есть (i), и если там после идёт микро подсказка, либо убирай её, либо в тултип»;
  «В STYLE полосе ненужный текст подсказки. При свёртывании на две строки рубится». 23 short notes after an (i) (the
  Model, the GPU memory preset, the theme's two faces, the chat address, the idea, Lyrics, VAE, Sliders, LoRAs, the two
  ways into a cover, the Score, the three Shape rows, ODE steps, Solver, Max length, Sound variations, MP3 bitrate, Peak
  clip, Style as tags) are their tips' first lines now: data-tip-head on an (i) of the markup, data-head on a label whose
  (i) help.js puts in; the tip shows it in bold over its text. The words were the catalogs' keys already, and
  data-tip-head is translated as data-tip is: all six languages, back and forth. The Style prompt's note goes: its box's
  placeholder says the same.
- «В Takes тоже Favorite звезду переведи в стандартную нашу иконку»: the star drawn as its neighbours, the thumbs; its
  words in the tip.
- «Когда трек "Move to Trash"… и если проигрывается в данный момент, сразу снимай его с проигрыша»: whichever way takes go
  to the trash (a card's menu, the checked ones, a workspace deleted), the Librarian tells the page which went (hooks.trashed),
  and the player lets the one it plays go at once.

The suite: 358 passed, 0 failed (5 new checks); the mock answers the lab's trash (nothing moves there).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
